  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 502.25 Stage II equipment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 502.25 “Stage II equipment” means all components and connections in a stage II system including but not limited to vapor return piping, coaxial hoses through which the vapor flows, gasoline nozzles, vapor pumps, and gasoline dispensers, as applicable.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 500) #10229, eff 11-17-12; ss by #13458, eff 10-7-22 (formerly Env-Or 502.29)",
